cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper given under
  preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "chapter4_qolu: QOLU and BUIA for multi-objective urban land-use planning"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of QOLU + BUIA, the multi-objective quantile-based
  multi-agent reinforcement learning system for urban land-use planning: the
  land-use environment built on UKCEH Land Cover Map rasters, the QOLU and BUIA
  agents, the P-MADDPG, LToS and MitM baselines, and the code that turns a set
  of runs into the tables and figures of Chapter 4 of the thesis.
authors:
